            ("Allegory", "A sustained narrative with two distinct levels of meaning: a literal surface story and a coherent symbolic moral, political, or spiritual interpretation (e.g., Animal Farm)", "A short funny limerick", "A simple factual diary", "A dictionary of terms"),
            ("Bildungsroman", "A literary genre focused on the psychological, moral, intellectual, and spiritual growth and maturation of a protagonist from youth to adulthood", "A crime mystery detective novel", "A collection of war poems", "A one-act farcical comedy"),
            ("Picaresque Novel", "An episodic novel recounting the colorful adventures and roguish exploits of a low-born, cynical, but appealing rascal surviving by wits in corrupt society", "A high court aristocratic romance", "A solemn religious hymnbook", "A treatise on scientific botany"),
